description: Multi-select controls should show selected names consistently.
globs: apps/web/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Multi-Select Display

- Multi-select triggers should summarize selected items by name, not by count alone.
- Show up to the first 3 selected names in order, then append `+N more` for overflow.
- Use the empty-state label only when no items are selected, for example `No subscribers`.
- For subscriber/notification-recipient multi-selects, default new forms to the currently logged-in user when available.
- Keep the full selected list in the popover/menu with checkmarks for selected rows.
